  "description": "Brazilian-Chinese DJ and producer Liu was born and raised in São Paulo and rhapsodizes about the supercity’s “chaotic, multicultural” beauty. “Creating music is all about being connected to anything that can spark an emotion,” he tells DJ Mag. That music usually takes the form of big Brazilian bass drops and big-room crowd-pleasers spliced with juicy pop and rap hooks.\n\nMeanwhile, his touring schedule has taken off this year, with gigs at Rock In Rio and a world tour around Kuala Lumpur, Bali, New York, Toronto and other places. “For next year, my dream is to keep releasing more and more music that brings positive feelings to people and to our amazing fans,” he offers.",
